        <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/ozdil" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ozdil</a></li>
        <li><strong>E-Posta / Web:</strong> <a href="https://ozanozdil.com">ozanozdil.com</a></li>
      </ul>
